  m_text: "Reason for this game even happening:\nThank you stardance for making the
    stardance challenge\nits the reason why this game is even here right now.\n\nIdea
    for the game:\nHugo Virtanen (me)\n\nGraphic designing and 3D models:\nHugo Virtanen\n\nInspiration:\nBackrooms(not
    the movie)\n and liminal spaces\n\nCredits for playtester:\nThank you Marcus
    for playtesting\nand giving good feedback for LASTSIGNAL\n\nSpecial thanks for
    support:\nThank you Silvonik for supporting\nme from the early days of LASTSIGNAL!\nAnd
    also for playtesting LASTSIGNAL\nif you liked this, go check out\nSilvonik's
    projects!\n\nAssistanse in bug fix:\nSuklaasukkulaYT\n\nScripting:\nHugo Virtanen\n\nStoryline
    and characters:\nHugo Virtanen\n\n"
